WEBVTT

00:10:58.487 --> 00:11:02.107
Memories unshackled and shining stitches

00:11:02.131 --> 00:11:04.104
on a stretch-marked heart.

00:11:04.405 --> 00:11:07.918
For the flowers that bloom
in midnight scars.

00:11:08.273 --> 00:11:11.559
How we suffered and sought a North Star.

00:11:11.583 --> 00:11:14.268
When there was no light, we glowed.

00:11:14.292 --> 00:11:16.913
We sparked this rejoice,

00:11:16.937 --> 00:11:18.877
this righteous delight.

00:11:18.901 --> 00:11:21.642
We have a cause to take joy in.

00:11:21.666 --> 00:11:23.917
How we weathered and persisted,

00:11:23.941 --> 00:11:25.091
tenacious,

00:11:25.115 --> 00:11:27.139
no stone unturned.

00:11:27.163 --> 00:11:30.794
How we witnessed the horror of mankind